  m_text: "<b>Dark and Darker prototype \u2014 controls</b>\nWASD move \xB7 Shift
    walk (quiet) \xB7 Space jump \xB7 Ctrl/C crouch (duck under swings)\nLMB attack
    / draw \xB7 RMB block \xB7 1 / 2 weapon sets \xB7 Tab inventory \xB7 F interact
    (hold)\nQ / E skills \xB7 Z X V R T spells \xB7 5 6 7 8 belt items \xB7 G rest
    \xB7 Esc cursor \xB7 H help\nLoot chests, descend by the red portal, escape through
    a blue portal before the Dark Swarm closes."
